From 7ddab471b97d660b236f695f9d68950040f87858 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheCryptoDonkey <TheCryptoDonkey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 13:43:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] feat: manage several login signers in Settings

Settings lists every enrolled login signer, each with its own Remove,
and keeps the add control until five are enrolled, then says why it is
gone. The add dialog offers only linked signers not yet enrolled. Recent
login attempts now name the signer that approved each one. The mock
backend enrols several signers (MOCK_SIGNER_ENROLLED=N) and reports the
approving signer in its status.
